      <activity id="5ca9f1c5-a0df-514b-8d80-716c4af584e0" activityNameId="a47800d4-fc48-5b2b-b6a9-f27c8fc10444" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cyclohexane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cyclohexane, at plant
The process "cyclohexane, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of cyclohexane from benzene in Europe.;
CAS number: 000110-82-7; 
Formula: C6H12; 
UUID: 345f7ede-101e-3910-a276-672ebee29969
Production of cyclohexane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hy&lt;drgenation of benzene
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production in the world  is around 3 Million tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are modelled with standard distances.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_345f7ede-101e-3910-a276-672ebee29969.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
